@page "/"

<PageTitle>magishira.dev</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <div class="intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">IT professional · Reno, Nevada</p>
        <h1>My little corner of the internet.</h1>
        <p class="lead">I'm Shira. I lead the endpoint-management student team at the University of Nevada, Reno, and I'm president of Nevada eSports, where I also run the technology.</p>
        <div class="btns">
            <a class="btn primary" href="#projects">See projects</a>
            <a class="btn" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <Crt />
</section>

<section id="work">
    <h2>What I do</h2>
    <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Endpoint management</h3>
            <p>SCCM and Jamf Pro for thousands of university computers: imaging, packaging, enrollment, GitLab CI/CD pipelines for SCCM, and the escalations when they break.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Automation &amp; reporting</h3>
            <p>Workflow redesigns that cut ticket resolution time by a full business day, and reports that put endpoint health in one view.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Development</h3>
            <p>Custom applications built on top of the university's endpoint platforms, plus a Rust front-end for a VPN client, a PHP identity provider, and this site in .NET. Small, fast, boring programs that do one thing well.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Infrastructure &amp; identity</h3>
            <p>A server cluster, Active Directory, and Group Policy at the university. Entra ID, Intune, and Azure for a 2,000-member organization. Proxmox and BGP for a small network operator.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="projects">
    <div class="sechead"><h2>Projects</h2><a class="btn sm" href="/projects">All projects</a></div>
    <div class="grid wide">
        @foreach (var p in ProjectList.Items.Where(p => p.Featured))
        {
            <div class="card">
                <h3>
                    @if (p.Live is not null) { <a href="@p.Live">@p.Name</a> } else { @p.Name }
                </h3>
                <p>@p.Blurb</p>
                @if (p.Source is not null)
                {
                    <p class="src"><a href="@p.Source"><Icon Name="source_branch" /> Source</a></p>
                }
                <div class="tags">@foreach (var t in p.Tags) { <span>@t</span> }</div>
            </div>
        }
    </div>
</section>

<section id="photos">
    <h2>Photos</h2>
    <ul class="carousel" aria-label="Photos">
        @foreach (var ph in PhotoList.Items)
        {
            <li><a href="@Assets[ph.File]"><img src="@Assets[ph.File]" alt="@ph.Alt" loading="lazy" width="@ph.Width" height="@ph.Height" /></a></li>
        }
    </ul>
</section>

<section id="about">
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>I got into IT by way of audio: running a high school sound and lighting team meant running the network under it. Off the clock, I'm usually doing one of these.</p>
    <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Games</h3>
            <p>Classic osu!, and Final Fantasy XIV for the story.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Photography</h3>
            <p>My surroundings and sometimes people, on a Canon 70D.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Live sound</h3>
            <p>Where this all started. I still mix now and then.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Making</h3>
            <p>3D printing, and the UNR 3D Printing Club wiki.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p class="lead">Email is best: <a href="mailto:shira@magishira.dev">shira@magishira.dev</a>. Also on <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/elane-faisal-sage">LinkedIn</a>, <a href="https://github.com/MagiShira">GitHub</a>, and <a href="https://discord.com/users/219501317532549120">Discord</a>. Résumé available on request.</p>
</section>
